{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53337","headline":"诗偈 四十八 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"报汝世人莫痴憨，暂时权住此草庵。\n无想衣食饱暖後，世间有物不须贪。\n此身幻化如灯焰，须臾不觉即头南。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}